      en: ["The coast hosts one of the largest mangrove areas near Dili.", "Over 50 different bird species have been recorded in the area.", "Salt production primarily takes place during the dry season.", "The area is part of a community-led ecotourism initiative.", "The waters off Dolok Oan are known for occasional dugong sightings.", "The name 'Dolok Oan' refers to 'small hills' in the local language."],
